<title>BERMUDA: ACE Ltd in $100 million share buyback.</title>
<headline>ACE Ltd in $100 million share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACE Ltd said on Friday it has authorized the repurchase of $100 million of company shares on the open market.</p>
</text>
